"Removes the saved password from MyDocHub. Your messages stay on your mail "
"server."
msgstr "የተቀመጠውን የይለፍ ቃል ከMyDocHub ያስወግዳል። መልእክቶችዎ በኢሜይል አገልጋይዎ ላይ ይቆያሉ።"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/setup.html:39
msgid "The mailbox will be disconnected from MyDocHub."
msgstr "የመልእክት ሳጥኑ ከMyDocHub ጋር ያለው ግንኙነት ይቋረጣል።"

