msgstr "አብነቴን ቅረጽ"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/template_new.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "Your balance: %(balance)s. It takes about half a minute."
msgstr "ቀሪ ሂሳብዎ፦ %(balance)s። ወደ ግማሽ ደቂቃ ያህል ይወስዳል።"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/templates.html:7
msgid ""
"A template gives every message of your company the same professional look: "
"logo, colours and a footer with your details. Make one with AI, then choose "
"it when you write."
msgstr ""
"አብነት ለእያንዳንዱ የኩባንያዎ መልእክት ተመሳሳይ ሙያዊ ገጽታ ይሰጣል፦ ሎጎ፣ ቀለሞች እና የእርስዎን ዝርዝሮች የያዘ "
"ግርጌ። በAI ያዘጋጁት፣ ከዚያ ሲጽፉ ይምረጡት።"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/templates.html:14
msgid "Open the preview"
msgstr "ቅድመ እይታውን ክፈት"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/templates.html:17
msgid "Use"
msgstr "ተጠቀም"

#: apps/mail/templates/mail/templates.html:18
msgid "Make default"
msgstr "ነባሪ አድርግ"

